{{ if eq (index . "role" | default "desktop") "agent-host" }}
# Agent hosts (headless, immutable image) take an allowlist: shell, git, editor
# and agent config. New desktop config stays off them by default. Units on the
# host are its own (shpool, srr-demo), so systemd is left alone entirely.
# Products/platform (.chezmoiexternal.toml) still applies: the clearhead skill
# links point into it, and chezmoi never touches an existing checkout.
*
